Package: TConstrain
Title: Topology-Constrained Trajectory Inference
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Xianzhe", "Hu", email = "xianzhe88888@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Constructs topology-constrained minimum spanning trees from
    cluster centroids for semi-supervised single-cell trajectory inference.
    Supports hard must-link and cannot-link relationships, plus soft priors
    including symmetric penalties for edges between different known time labels.
